'''Omens''' (オーメンズ, ''Ōmenzu'', '''Omens''') are an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]]/[[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] variant of [[Cerberus Kids]] that appears in [[Attack of the Omens]]. They were added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Omens
|image = E 637.png
|first appearance = [[Attack of the Omens]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
Omens rapidly deliver three closely-spaced multi-hits in each short attack cycle at a whopping 430 range. Each attack has a 30% chance to freeze and generate a level 1 [[Surge Attack|Surge]], further escalating the threat they pose. The long Surge spawn area reaching up to 950 puts even super-backliners such as [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] at risk if Omens are given the chance to push even slightly.

==Strategy==
:''See [[Attack of the Omens/Three Omens Lv.1~20]].''

