==Trivia==
*Omens' Japanese name, Ōmenzu (オーメンズ), is a pun on 大 ''Ō'' (big), オーメンズ ''ōmenzu'' (omens) and メンズ ''menzu'' (men, mens or men's), referring to their [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] attribute/size, the bad omens the [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] bring and how they are a group of men.
*They are the only Colossus enemy to have multiple orbs in their design instead of just one.

